I don't believe more monsters are generated when the level goes up.

> Worried has exactly one result - Up the stairs one or
> even several floors.  If the level is higher than your
> XP number early on, you're in trouble.

Personally, I don't ever compare dungeon level and my own level. If 
either goes up, the result is the same, so only the sum is important.

If you stay low and let your level rise fast, the result is the same as 
when you descend fast, keeping your own level low.

The latter does get you more monsters in the same number of moves, 
though, but is also gets you a broader assortment of goodies to 
compensate for that.

