>> Alright death to the grid bugs.  With luck kitten and I will make it
>> to the stairs before the ants can catch up with us.

> Second mistake.  Use the grid bugs as a blocker when
> faced with much stronger monsters.

And let your pet kill the weaker monsters. It will gain experience and 
grow into a big pet. For your pet, it doesn't matter what monster it 
kills: every creature big or small gives him the same amount of 
experience. Keep the big monsters to yourself, and kill them from a 
distance with spells or daggers. They give *you* much more experience 
than small monsters.

